        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Highland station, Austin, Texas\n- Systems: Capital MetroRail\n- Places: Highland Mall, I-35/Highway 290 interchange\n\nFacts:\n- Highland Mall opened in 1971 as Austin's first suburban shopping mall.\n- Highland is a Capital MetroRail commuter rail station in Austin, Texas, USA.\n- Highland station is in northeast Austin at the intersection of Airport Boulevard and Highland Mall Boulevard.\n- Highland station is just northwest of the I-35/Highway 290 interchange and directly across the street from Highland Mall.",
